{
  "label": "Publish the pattern",
  "description": "Writes the doc to its path and adds its index row. Publishes only on approve.",
  "inputs": {
    "area": {
      "kind": "text",
      "schema": {
        "type": "string"
      }
    },
    "doc": {
      "kind": "blob",
      "schema": {
        "type": "string",
        "contentMediaType": "text/markdown"
      }
    },
    "doc_path": {
      "kind": "text",
      "schema": {
        "type": "string"
      }
    },
    "entry": {
      "kind": "json",
      "schema": {
        "type": "object"
      }
    },
    "amendment": {
      "kind": "blob",
      "schema": {
        "type": "string",
        "contentMediaType": "text/markdown"
      }
    },
    "decision": {
      "kind": "text",
      "schema": {
        "type": "string"
      }
    },
    "catalog": {
      "kind": "text",
      "schema": {
        "type": "string"
      }
    }
  },
  "outputs": {
    "paths": {
      "kind": "json",
      "binding": {
        "op": {
          "kind": "function",
          "functionRef": "op.member",
          "input": {
            "value": {
              "kind": "json",
              "binding": {
                "op": {
                  "kind": "function",
                  "functionRef": "op.member",
                  "input": {
                    "value": {
                      "kind": "json",
                      "binding": {
                        "op": {
                          "kind": "function",
                          "functionRef": "context.get",
                          "input": {
                            "name": {
                              "kind": "text",
                              "binding": {
                                "text": "operation"
                              }
                            }
                          },
                          "output": {
                            "name": "value",
                            "kind": "json"
                          }
                        }
                      }
                    },
                    "prop": {
                      "kind": "text",
                      "binding": {
                        "text": "output"
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  "output": {
                    "name": "value",
                    "kind": "json"
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            "prop": {
              "kind": "text",
              "binding": {
                "text": "paths"
              }
            }
          },
          "output": {
            "name": "value",
            "kind": "json"
          }
        }
      },
      "name": "paths"
    }
  },
  "operation": {
    "kind": "prompt",
    "user": "Write one doc into the doc tree and add its index row.\n\n## The doc\n\n{{.inputs.doc}}\n\n## Its path\n\n{{.inputs.doc_path}}\n\n## The entry it describes\n\n{{.inputs.entry}}\n\n## Mockups\n\n{{.inputs.mockups}}\n\n## The amendment\n\n{{.inputs.amendment}}\n\n## The decision\n\n{{.inputs.decision}}\n\nPublish only on `approve`. On anything else, write nothing and report what you would have written.\n\n## What to do\n\nWrite the doc to its path with `write_file`. Add its row to `{{.inputs.catalog}}`: a row and a link, nothing else. Apply the amendment to the standing doc it names. Change no other text.\n\n## What to produce\n\n`paths`: every path written or edited.\n",
    "config": {
      "model": "claude-cli/default"
    },
    "input": {},
    "output": {
      "name": "output",
      "kind": "json",
      "schema": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "paths": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "paths"
        ]
      }
    }
  },
  "environment": {
    "tools": [
      "read_file",
      "glob",
      "grep",
      "edit",
      "write_file",
      "bash",
      "web_fetch",
      "web_search"
    ],
    "permissions": {
      "tools": {
        "read_file": "allow",
        "glob": "ask",
        "grep": "ask",
        "edit": "ask",
        "write_file": "allow",
        "bash": "ask",
        "web_fetch": "ask",
        "web_search": "ask",
        "jaira:toolset+": "allow",
        "jaira:toolset-": "deny"
      },
      "other": "ask",
      "subjects": {
        "bash": "ask"
      },
      "source": "$/toolsets/feature/write-files",
      "functions": {
        "bash": "smart"
      },
      "implementations": {},
      "scopes": [
        {
          "path": "docs/product/**",
          "tools": {
            "read_file": "allow"
          }
        },
        {
          "path": "docs/ux/**",
          "tools": {
            "read_file": "allow"
          }
        },
        {
          "path": "docs/_templates/**",
          "tools": {
            "read_file": "allow"
          }
        },
        {
          "path": "docs/ux/**",
          "tools": {
            "read_file": "allow",
            "write_file": "allow"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  },
  "slotMeta": {
    "inputs.area": {
      "default": "ux"
    },
    "inputs.doc": {
      "optional": true
    },
    "inputs.doc_path": {
      "optional": true
    },
    "inputs.entry": {
      "optional": true
    },
    "inputs.amendment": {
      "optional": true
    },
    "inputs.decision": {
      "optional": true
    },
    "inputs.catalog": {
      "default": "docs/ux/index.md"
    }
  }
}
